---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { APP_URL } from '../lib/app-url';
---

<SiteLayout pageTitle="About" tagline="Providing free tools and resources for accountability">
  <section id="about">
    <h2>About</h2>

    <p>
      The Virtue Initiative is an organization that aims to provide free tools and resources for
      accountability. We currently offer a free screenshot-based accountability app and some
      resources on how to use it well.
    </p>

    <div class="about-callout">
      <p>
        Our mission is to develop free technology and resources to support people who want to be
        free from pornography. We know what it&apos;s like to feel stuck, and we want to provide
        tools to support you. We don&apos;t want the price to be yet another excuse not to deal with
        pornography.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p>
      Our vision is to see the Christian church and the world freed from pornography. There are
      billions of dollars made by keeping men and women stuck. For many people, it starts from a
      young age, and it&apos;s hard to give up, even if they desperately want to. We want to provide
      tools to provide support and make it easier.
    </p>

    <p>
      The Virtue Initiative began in February 2026 when we started looking at accountability apps.
      There were a few options but none of them were free. We thought, &quot;What if we can make a
      free version while keeping most of the essential features of other paid services?&quot; Our
      goal is to fundraise all our financial support and keep the app free.
    </p>

    <p>
      Hopefully you&apos;re willing to join us on this mission. If you&apos;ve been or know someone
      who&apos;s been struggling to break free from porn,
      <a href={`${APP_URL}/signup`}>sign up</a> now or send this to them. You might also want to read
      <a href="/help/tips"> this page on tips to beat pornography. </a>
    </p>

    <p>
      If you wish to support us monetarily, you can donate (at some point). If you have any
      questions, feel free to contact us at
      <a href="mailto:help@virtueinitiative.org">help@virtueinitiative.org</a>
      or join our <a href="https://discord.gg/4kNsbRuzQD">Discord server</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style is:global>
  #about h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.8vw, 1.95rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  #about p,
  #about li {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  #about p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .about-callout {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .about-callout p {
    font-size: 1.12rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text) !important;
    margin-top: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.85 !important;
  }
</style>
